    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists and friends dont get it though. they just want me to keep functioning so i can keep being useful to everyone else. like everyone wants me to be a \"good employee\" or a \"good citizen\" but nobody actually cares about the person inside. i feel like if i just stopped... if i just wasn't part of the cycle anymore, maybe it would finally feel like i actually had control over something. like the only thing i truly own is my ability to walk away.",
